    // is not re-added from an old card: the disagreement it displayed is exactly what the operator ruled
    // retired (`TODOS.md` part one item 71, "Retire it"). What stands of that card is the half that was
    // right - a row showing a build many commits behind a machine that has been updated is worse than a row
