    //   no answer yet        -> "version: not read yet"
    //   asked and refused    -> "version: not read" + the host's own words in the hover
    //   the host answered    -> the version marker, built in the ONE place below, with the file it came from in the hover
    // SUPERSEDED, on its last two lines, by T-883 (2026-11-17, the operator's words on this ask, verbatim): "in the
    // text, add a \"v\" ... so it displays v0.1.0 currently - and make sure the information is SSOT - only one version
    // marker in the plugin code, no hardcoded text!" The sentence it wrote — "the host's string and nothing else: no
    // \"v\", no padding, no re-formatting" — is what `tests/ui_state.test.cjs` has pinned since T-519, and that pin is
    // re-expressed by this change, not dropped. What did NOT move: the manifest stays the number's only home (the host
